nostr-faucet (0.1.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Mission 11.1.
  * NWC pay_bip321, on-chain branch, backed by bitcoind.
  * Open policy: a per-key quota, a request rate limit, and a total cap
    that is refused even to a key inside its own quota.
  * Runs as its own user; the service dials out and listens on no port.

